  "body": "Hi, I am trying to use this on Alpine linux and regrettably the compilation does not go smoothly; this mostly complains about unknown identifiers (like `struct stat64`...). Would you consider building for musl?\n\nTo reproduce:\n```\nFROM alpine:latest AS builder\nRUN apk add build-base curl git musl-fts-dev\nRUN cd /tmp && git clone https://github.com/fritzw/ld-preload-open\nRUN cd /tmp/ld-preload-open && sed -i 's/-Wall//' Makefile && make\n```",
